OL,3,GNEWSAReform small boat vote branded
OL,4,A'political stunt'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA vote calling on the government not to
OL,7,Fland any more migrant crossings in
OL,8,FPortsmouth has been labelled "a
OL,9,Fpolitical stunt" by its council leader.
OL,11,FThe authority held an extraordinary
OL,12,Fmeeting on Thursday, at which
OL,13,Fcouncillors voted to reject the
OL,14,Fproposal, following the arrival of 120
OL,15,Fpeople at Eastney on 6 September.
OL,17,FReform UK councillor George Madgwick
OL,18,Fsaid he proposed the motion because
OL,19,FPortsmouth was "not a suitable
OL,20,Fdisembarkation point" for small boats.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,337,330,200,160,0,100
